      "id": "cover",
      "eyebrow": "Agent Harness 工程",
      "title": "Harness 工程实践三家谈",
      "content": {
        "kind": "cover",
        "equation": "Harness = 环境·会话·安全·可恢复",
        "meta": [
          [
            "讲师",
            "AI 老师"
          ],
          [
            "来源",
            "OpenAI/DeepSeek/Anthropic 官方"
          ],
