      "script": [
        {
          "text": "先看总览表。OpenAI Codex CLI 完全开源,Apache-2.0,主打三档安全审批和自定义协议。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-overview-table-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "DeepSeek 的 dsh 是 MIT 许可,它的 Cordis 内核把所有东西都做成插件,能热插拔,还能完整回放每一步。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-overview-table-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Anthropic 走托管服务路线,把会话、沙箱、大脑全解耦,重点在生产级安全隔离。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-overview-table-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "共同点是,三家都把安全隔离和会话追溯当成核心问题。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-overview-table-s3.mp3"
        }
      ],
